Only team blue has secret values (items 6-10: YE, AL, ZS, PN, SX). The messages break down as follows:

- **#0** is from the holder, anon-10f0, to team blue. It lists "YE AL ZS PN SX" for items 6-10 exactly as written, so it carries all five items openly.
- **#1** is from anon-d7a3 to team blue and repeats the same list, so it also carries all five items openly.
- **#2 to #17** are all team red messages. Their values for items 6-10 (BP, RD, BC, BC, BH) do not match the blue secrets, so none of them carries a blue value.

