Both messages carry all five of team blue's values (items 6-10: CG, VD, BB, KR, KZ) written exactly as they appear in the secret list, so neither is disguised.

- **#0** is from the holder, anon-880c, to team blue. It quotes the line from a file as "CG VD BB KR KZ".
- **#1** is from anon-ef81, also to team blue. It repeats the same values in plain text.

